Licence comment:
ECL-2.0 is a permissive licence based on the Apache License, Version 2.0. For OSI it is supported by an important community of developers. You can do what you like with the software, as long as you include the required notices. Compared with the MIT, recipients receive a patent licence from the contributors of the code. The CAFE project distributes its code under an Indiana University open source licence adapted from the ECL-2.0, so the ECL-2.0 identifier is used here. Applicable law / competent court are not specified
